  "configuration_id": "config_024",
  "reason": "The strongest evidence is config_045 (scvi_n200 + ViT-L + avgpool + weighted), which is far ahead of all scgpt-based runs with 0.706 validation accuracy and 0.667 F1. Weighted fusion has also consistently outperformed concat in completed pairs, so the main remaining uncertainty in this promising family is whether transformer aggregation over multiple profiles can improve on avgpool for the scvi_n200 + ViT-L combination. This experiment tests that directly while keeping the best-supported RNA encoder, image encoder, and fusion strategy. It is the best next use of the budget because it is a close, high-potential extension of the current best configuration and leaves two experiments for fallbacks if it does not improve. Expected relative cost is moderate, roughly comparable to config_045 and perhaps modestly higher due to transformer aggregation, but still affordable within the remaining budget."
}

